error: a named aggregate literal places '{' directly after its type
  --> examples/diagnostics/1287-diagnostics-named-aggregate-separator-dot.sx:11:16
   |
11 |     b := Button.{ label = "Play" };
   |                ^

help: write the type, then '{'
   |
11 |     b := Button{ label = "Play" };
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
